/-! # The Seventh source vector with literal odd short terms

The odd short terms of `seventhSrcVecW 64` are read off the packed word tensor by `twTriOdd`, whose
kernel evaluation over all `24` columns exceeds the memory budget.  This module checks them column
by column (six kernel evaluations of four columns) against literal lists and gives the equal
representation `seventhSrcVecL` with a literal odd block, cheap to evaluate as an identification
source.  Densities: 552 pair, 14784 octad,
12288 odd short terms. -/

